                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a333f0f-680c-377b-b2df-b2b7835e974f",
                        "entry_id": "d8d57b08-1ed3-362b-8a08-b2fb0ea4d3f2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Photocomposition of type."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "933eadff-8e4a-4b44-a617-6339051e8da4",
                                "sense_id": "4a333f0f-680c-377b-b2df-b2b7835e974f",
                                "text": "There is too, at this point in time, an aesthetic disadvantage to filmsetting in that the range of type faces specially designed for it is still extremely limited."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dae213cf-43fa-4ca5-9ac3-942db58b673c",
                                "sense_id": "4a333f0f-680c-377b-b2df-b2b7835e974f",
                                "text": "However, filmsettings are sometimes made deliberately over size, with the intention that they shall be photographically reduced - some of the machines cannot cope with type sizes smaller than about eight or ten point."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4df7c010-caf0-44ec-b391-7e7c463ae1b8",
                                "sense_id": "4a333f0f-680c-377b-b2df-b2b7835e974f",
                                "text": "But on the filmsetting machine, the matrix case, which on the hot-metal caster had contained metal matrices, now contained tiny photographic negatives of each character."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f028d4c9-fbad-460a-9734-3221240c48f0",
                                "sense_id": "4a333f0f-680c-377b-b2df-b2b7835e974f",
                                "text": "In filmsetting it is almost impossible to define where 'widows' will occur when copy marking or setting at the keyboard."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
